	"descriptionMarkdown": "[Updated 25.03.2026]\n\n☢️ Cloudiboy’s Kovarex Blueprint Book – Standard / Beaconed / Legendary ☢️\n\nHey there! 😊\n\nI'm Cloudiboy, and I’m excited to share my Kovarex Enrichment Blueprint Book with you!\nIt includes three versions tailored for different stages of your factory: 🏗️🔧\n\n📦 What’s Inside?\n\n1. Standard Version – Clean and simple, perfect for early uranium setups. ✅\n\n2. Beaconed Version – Boosted with productivity and speed for mid- to late-game. ⚡🔋\n\n3. Legendary Version – The real powerhouse. This one's the highlight! 💥👑\n\n🌟 Legendary Kovarex – The Ultimate Setup\n\nThe Legendary Version doesn’t just enrich uranium –\nit produces Legendary Uranium-238, Legendary Uranium-235,\nand Legendary Uranium Fuel Cells! ☢️💚🔥\n\n⚠️ Important Note\n\n👉 To get the full performance of the legendary, make sure your ore inserters are equipped with Quality Modules! 💎⚙️\nWithout them, the enrichment process won’t reach its true legendary potential –\nand production might slow down. ⛔🐌\n\n🚀 Ready to Use\n\nJust pick the version that fits your current setup and plug it in.\nEverything’s optimized and ready to fuel your nuclear ambitions. 🔧💡\n\nHope this helps you power up your factory – the legendary way!\n– Cloudiboy 👋🙂",
